  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be completed before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (3327-01/FP & 3327-04/FP, received on 10/01/2019;\r\n3327-05/FP/A & Unnumbered Cycle Storage Specification, received on 05/03/2019;\r\n3327-02/FP/B, 3327-03/FP/B & 3327-06/FP/A, received on 20/03/2019) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in changes to the elevations hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the first occupation of the dwellinghouse hereby approved, all fascia signage and the signage board on the side elevation of the property shall be removed.",
    "Condition : 5 - The building, subject to this application, shall be used as a dwellinghouse within the meaning of Class C3 of the Schedule to the Use Classes Order and for no other purpose, except to the extent that the other purpose is ancillary to the primary use of such a dwellinghouse.",
    "Condition : 6 - Prior to first occupation of the unit hereby approved, the approved cycle parking details shall be constructed and available for use and retained as such thereafter."
